			(late Lat.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.,
					<i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 8, 11 <i>med.</i></span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Esp., in music, <i>an interval</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 9, § 948</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Censor. 13</span></i>.</div>
